flowchart LR
    U[Browser UI] --> API[FastAPI]
    API --> PARSE[Local document parsing<br/>PDF · DOCX · TXT · MD]
    PARSE --> CHUNK[Word-window chunks<br/>page metadata · overlap]
    CHUNK --> EMB[Multilingual E5 embeddings<br/>FastEmbed / ONNX Runtime]
    EMB --> DB[(SQLite<br/>chunk metadata + vectors)]
    CHUNK --> FTS[(SQLite FTS5<br/>BM25 lexical index)]
    Q[User question] --> QE[Query embedding]
    QE --> DENSE[Exact cosine top-k]
    DB --> DENSE
    Q --> LEX[FTS5 BM25]
    FTS --> LEX
    DENSE --> RRF[Reciprocal-rank fusion]
    LEX --> RRF
    RRF --> CITE[Ranked passages<br/>stable source IDs]
    CITE --> GEN{LLM configured?}
    GEN -->|No| EXTRACT[Quoted extractive answer]
    GEN -->|Yes, opt-in| LLM[OpenAI-compatible generation<br/>source-bounded prompt]
    EXTRACT --> RESP[Answer + source snippets]
    LLM --> VALIDATE[Allow-list citation IDs]
    VALIDATE --> RESP
    RESP --> U
